Run a deterministic health scan on an unpacked firmware directory

Usage: android-doctor doctor [OPTIONS] <COMMAND>

Commands:
  scan     Scan a directory and report findings
  install  Write the agent skill into an agent config dir so a coding agent can use this tool
  help     Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
      --no-color  Never emit colour, even on a terminal (also honours the NO_COLOR environment variable)
  -h, --help      Print help
